# Normalise line endings so a checkout on Windows produces byte-identical files
# to one on Linux.
#
# `npm run check` regenerates the Go client and the TypeScript types and fails
# if they differ from what is committed. Line-ending conversion on checkout
# would make that check fail on Windows for reasons unrelated to the contract.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated — diffing it is the review, so it must never be reformatted.
openapi/*.yaml text eol=lf
go/cloudclient/*.gen.go text eol=lf
ts/src/*.gen.ts text eol=lf
